{"name":"Dress Up","hex":"#fac7bf","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dress up","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To put on special or fancy clothes.","To put on a costume portraying oneself as a particular type of character or well-known person."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dress_up"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dress-up","blocks":[{"text":"Dress-up is a children's game in which costumes or clothing are put on a person or on a doll, for role-playing or aesthetics purposes. In the UK the game is called dressing up. In the mid-1990s, dress-up games also became a video game genre in which customizing a virtual character's appearance is the primary focus."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Kinder_feiern_Halloween_-_2004.jpg/330px-Kinder_feiern_Halloween_-_2004.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dress-up"},{"title":"Dress","blocks":[{"text":"A dress is a one-piece outer garment that is worn on the torso, hanging down over the legs. Dresses often consist of a bodice attached to a skirt."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Afternoon_ensemble_MET_63.212a-b_CP4.jpg/330px-Afternoon_ensemble_MET_63.212a-b_CP4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dress"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Dress_MET_19.181.1_F2.jpeg/500px-Dress_MET_19.181.1_F2.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Dress_MET_19.181.1_F2.jpeg/1280px-Dress_MET_19.181.1_F2.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Dress_MET_19.181.1_F2.jpeg/500px-Dress_MET_19.181.1_F2.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=pars